---
// Home Page Introduction Section (Full Details)
---
<section id="about" class="py-24 bg-charcoal text-offwhite scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
    
    <!-- Section Title -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold">About <span class="text-gold">Us</span></h2>
      <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold mx-auto mt-4"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
      <!-- Left Column: Text Content -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold mb-6">
          Your Vision, <span class="text-gold">Our Expertise</span>
        </h3>
        
        <!-- Introduction -->
        <p class="text-offwhite/70 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Located in the heart of Kitui Town (Kilungya Street, opposite Parkside Hotel), Stoms Studios is a premier creative hub. We don't just capture images; we craft stories, record timeless audio, and train the next generation of creatives.
        </p>
        
        <p class="text-offwhite/70 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Whether you need a graduation shoot, a full choir recording, or professional drone coverage, our team of experienced producers, instrumentalists, and choir trainers is equipped to deliver exceptional quality.
        </p>

        <!-- Mission & Vision List -->
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-serif font-bold text-gold mb-2">Our Mission</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-offwhite/60 leading-relaxed">
              To provide high-quality, accessible audiovisual and music production services that empower local artists, document important life events, and preserve cultural stories through professional media.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-serif font-bold text-gold mb-2">Our Vision</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-offwhite/60 leading-relaxed">
              To be the leading creative and audiovisual hub in the Eastern region of Kenya, recognized for producing world-class media, nurturing top-tier musical talent, and setting the standard for professional studio services.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Image -->
      <div class="relative h-[500px] rounded-sm overflow-hidden border border-white/10 shadow-2xl">
        <!-- object-top ensures heads are not cut off -->
        <img src="/images/gallery-9.jpg" alt="Stoms Studios Team" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>